Why C-Series
Certified Efficiencies. Build-ready.
Quality
80 PLUS Bronze, Gold and Platinum efficiency, superb noise ratings, and a full suite of built-in protections — engineered to power your build for years.
Performance
ATX 3.1 compliance, 12V-2x6 PCIe 5.1 connectivity, and rock-solid voltage regulation handle modern GPU power spikes with stability — even at peak load.
Usability
Fully modular flat or individually embossed cables, hybrid silent fan modes, and digital control make installation and tuning effortless — clean builds, simple setup.
Warranty
Up to ten years, full coverage, no questions on coil whine or buzzing. The floor for serious consideration in the category. The PSU decision you make this decade.
